{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/LexnLin/status/2076422557180608888","id":"2076422557180608888","text":"","raw_text":{"text":"https://t.co/TW0aIfhuGO","display_text_range":[0,23],"facets":[]},"author":{"screen_name":"LexnLin","url":"https://x.com/LexnLin","id":"1906264743440183296","followers":19841,"following":654,"likes":45943,"media_count":2010,"name":"Leon Lin","description":"highschool | building cool shit\n\nhttp://github.com/Leonxlnx/taste-skill | @_TasteSkill","raw_description":{"text":"highschool | building cool shit\n\nhttps://t.co/WAZzwj2wvN | @_TasteSkill","facets":[{"type":"url","indices":[33,56],"original":"https://t.co/WAZzwj2wvN","replacement":"http://github.com/Leonxlnx/taste-skill","display":"github.com/Leonxlnx/taste…"}]},"location":"muc","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1906264743440183296/1775051154","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2030215945751248896/UIEzJ9Vq_200x200.jpg","joined":"Sun Mar 30 08:38:55 +0000 2025","protected":false,"website":{"url":"http://www.tasteskill.dev","display_url":"tasteskill.dev"},"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":51,"retweets":169,"likes":2141,"bookmarks":6352,"quotes":39,"created_at":"Sun Jul 12 21:44:50 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1783892690,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":828722,"is_note_tweet":false,"community_note":null,"lang":null,"replying_to":null,"replying_to_status":null,"source":"Twitter Web App","article":{"created_at":"2026-07-12T21:44:50.000Z","modified_at":"2026-07-12T21:44:50.000Z","id":"2076327982847647744","title":"How To Actually Design With AI","preview_text":"Design has always been one of the areas where AI struggles to match human ability. But most people still misunderstand what designing with AI actually means. Designing with AI does not mean asking it","cover_media":{"id":"QXBpTWVkaWE6DAAFCgABHNDvPf3WUAAKAAIadGmvMJpwAAAA","media_id":"2076422477748523008","media_info":{"__typename":"ApiImage","color_info":{"palette":[{"percentage":60.42,"rgb":{"blue":196,"green":206,"red":216}},{"percentage":23.5,"rgb":{"blue":49,"green":52,"red":53}},{"percentage":7.61,"rgb":{"blue":35,"green":71,"red":155}},{"percentage":1.61,"rgb":{"blue":91,"green":143,"red":176}},{"percentage":0.17,"rgb":{"blue":52,"green":84,"red":115}}]},"original_img_height":793,"original_img_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNDvPf3WUAASbRg.jpg","original_img_width":1983},"media_key":"3_2076422477748523008"},"content":{"blocks":[{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7bd23","text":"Design has always been one of the areas where AI struggles to match human ability. But most people still misunderstand what designing with AI actually means. Designing with AI does not mean asking it to do everything for you. The idea, direction, feeling, and creativity should still come from you.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"35s72","text":"AI is there to help you execute.\nHere is the process in simple terms:","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ei9j9","text":"You develop the idea.","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"eh4l9","text":"You gather inspiration.","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e8lvp","text":"You translate your thinking into prompts and use AI to build it.","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bgj7e","text":"You can use tools like Cursor, Codex, Claude, or any harness. Basically at its core, you are turning your thoughts into instructions. AI can execute extremely well, but it still lacks true creativity. It understands design rules like spacing, typography, color theory, and hierarchy.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6poit","text":"But it does not understand taste. It does not know what feels original, meaningful, or genuinely good.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2gqpc","text":"That is the gap.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"a7t86","text":"You cannot give AI real taste yet, but you can work around that limitation.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1h349","text":"Method 1: Use a Design Skill","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6ha7a","text":"This is the fastest approach. If you are short on time or working on something small, you can rely on prebuilt design skills.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"cshdq","text":"Some examples:","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":0,"length":10,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"57h8c","text":"Impeccable","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":1,"length":25,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"206v3","text":"Emil Kowalski’s UI skills","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":0,"text":"Skills.sh","toIndex":9}]},"entityRanges":[{"key":2,"length":9,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"b0s4h","text":"Skills.sh","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":3,"length":10,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4nsll","text":"TasteSkill","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2jipv","text":"TasteSkill Version 2 is also coming soon with a dedicated GPT 5.6 one first. :)","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dl7s","text":"The process is simple:","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"aqd8k","text":"Add a design skill.","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"cm42r","text":"Give the AI context.","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"f2dh5","text":"Prompt it a few times to create your site/app/poster","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8k7p3","text":"Fix obvious issues.","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"djr21","text":"Ship it.","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e9m5s","text":"The result will usually be decent. It may still feel similar to other AI-generated designs, but good skills help avoid the worst mistakes/slop. This is what most people use.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bs93f","text":"Method 2: Design It Yourself With AI","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"60bnd","text":"If you want something that actually stands out, you need to go deeper. You want people to land on your product and feel that real thought went into it. That requires a more intentional process.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e680h","text":"You might be building:","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2dud0","text":"A mobile app","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9av80","text":"A desktop app","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"akdb4","text":"A website","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4ss73","text":"A landing page","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3d4l0","text":"A dashboard","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3gsg8","text":"A poster","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"66eaj","text":"Whatever it is, you need a clear direction first. If you do not know what you are building, AI will not figure it out for you.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5emph","text":"Start With Meaning","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7olor","text":"Before anything else, define the foundation.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7ao67","text":"Ask yourself:","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"22dfk","text":"Who is this for?","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3h7m0","text":"What problem does it solve?","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"be5fq","text":"What should it feel like?","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6ntpc","text":"What should it represent?","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"iv6t","text":"The UI should reflect the meaning of the product. Write this down. You can also use AI here, but not for design. Let it ask you questions instead.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"66gk6","text":"For example:","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5mmpv","text":"What is the product about?","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3u8hd","text":"Who is the audience?","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fnp4k","text":"What feeling should it communicate?","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"283jh","text":"What should the branding feel like?","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fv903","text":"What colors and fonts fit?","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8e9di","text":"Should it feel minimal, playful, premium, technical, or experimental?","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ef649","text":"Collect Inspiration","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":4,"length":6,"offset":73}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1j8po","text":"Once you have direction, start collecting references. A strong source is Mobbin.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"496vm","text":"It has real product screens across many categories. Do not just look at designs and think “this looks good.”","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dqvd9","text":"Ask yourself why.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"72urj","text":"Is it the layout?","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"53l1p","text":"The spacing?","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8ta0m","text":"The typography?","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8k4r7","text":"The structure?","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2p4i7","text":"The interaction?","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"61au5","text":"Save anything useful.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"32pv8","text":"Organize it into folders like:","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"cndeg","text":"Navigation","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"15t2i","text":"Heroes","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e2f3g","text":"Pricing","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7gpbf","text":"Cards","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"clitr","text":"Mobile screens","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dhqmv","text":"Dashboards","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8n4mg","text":"Animations","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6plu0","text":"Typography","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ctc9h","text":"Build your own reference library over time. That is also hw you develop \"taste\".","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"a2aab","text":"(The Mobbin link is an affiliate link. You can get 10% off your first three months, and I may receive a commission at no extra cost.)","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2gvch","text":"Other useful sources:","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":5,"length":9,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"177qt","text":"Pinterest","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":6,"length":6,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2dd40","text":"Cosmos","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":7,"length":8,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"amith","text":"Awwwards","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":8,"length":17,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"c3vti","text":"Webflow Templates","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":9,"length":9,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2vua1","text":"Craftwork","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":10,"length":15,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"61dut","text":"Rebrand Gallery","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":11,"length":17,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e7o4b","text":"Component Gallery","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":12,"length":5,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5m717","text":"Savee","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":13,"length":5,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"238of","text":"Lummi","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1cv6e","text":"also:\nDo not copy entire designs. Combine ideas into something that fits your product.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4ak8p","text":"Map the Structure","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1nqkc","text":"Now define what you actually need to build.\nFor a website:","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6v10a","text":"Navigation","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"esnv","text":"Hero","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8ef7b","text":"Features","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fi9l2","text":"Pricing","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bncst","text":"Testimonials","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9cek1","text":"CTA","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3a0m6","text":"Footer","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"770ph","text":"For apps:","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"91pj9","text":"Onboarding","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"egma1","text":"Home","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bdj8v","text":"Search","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"uo6s","text":"Profile","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"67c7r","text":"Settings","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7a2hu","text":"Core flows","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e2t8i","text":"Empty states","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fmfja","text":"Each section needs clear content.\nFor example, a hero needs:","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"91bgv","text":"Headline","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2190p","text":"Description","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1d0da","text":"CTA","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6n3uc","text":"Visual","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bqs5v","text":"AI can help with copy, but clarity still comes from you.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9dbf2","text":"Build Component by Component","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e3g9h","text":"Now you start building. Take individual ideas from your references and adapt them.\nInstead of saying: “Build me a full website”","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"25lf3","text":"Say: “Create a hero section based on this style, adapted to my branding.”","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4geko","text":"Work step by step:","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e0pi","text":"Navigation","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2jnst","text":"Hero","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"aahfs","text":"Cards","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"cklel","text":"Buttons","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5ri4e","text":"Typography","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fq7c9","text":"Details","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7n4ju","text":"AI performs much better with smaller tasks. You also keep control.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fs1i2","text":"Generate Custom Assets","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dmmkk","text":"Use image generation when needed. Tools like GPT Images 2.0 or Seedream 5.0 are strong enough now.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"b255e","text":"Give clear context:","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"cmm56","text":"Colors","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9gnba","text":"Style","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7cbeu","text":"Composition","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bqq1a","text":"Use case","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4rjsm","text":"Avoid generic stock images. Custom visuals make everything feel more cohesive.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1ma92","text":"The Workflow","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"al0fv","text":"The full process:","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5ee19","text":"Define the idea","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3ortk","text":"Clarify purpose and audience","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"87gkt","text":"Set branding direction","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dqghs","text":"Collect references","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2fb5o","text":"Organize them","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dm2gd","text":"Map structure","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"baf05","text":"Build components","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2obfi","text":"Generate assets","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6db6i","text":"Add interactions","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ffnlp","text":"Refine everything","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3o7rq","text":"This produces far better results than one prompt.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5om35","text":"Method 3: Use an Inspiration Board","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ar8sv","text":"There is a faster middle ground. Instead of building everything piece by piece, you can give AI a curated set of references.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"c8m4u","text":"Collect screenshots from:","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":14,"length":6,"offset